Third-party upscaler binaries and models
=======================================

Texture Manager 2 bundles ncnn-Vulkan sidecars and neural-network weights
for AI upscaling. Those components remain under their upstream licenses.
This file is shipped with the application so MIT and BSD-3-Clause
redistribution conditions are met.

